      "title": {
        "en": "Patient and friendly mobile groomers"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently praise mobile technicians including Megan, Sally, Rochelle, and Crystal for their gentle demeanor and professional communication. Clients appreciate that groomers explain procedures clearly and keep pets calm throughout appointments. Pet owners report feeling comfortable trusting their animals to the staff."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 19,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for diverse pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently note that anxious, senior, and temperamental animals receive compassionate and gentle treatment inside the mobile vans. Multiple reviewers highlight successful sessions with cats, rabbits, and timid dogs who typically struggle at conventional grooming facilities. Pets return home calm and happy."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Quality styling and fresh coats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients describe satisfying grooming outcomes across varied dog breeds, mentioning tidy haircuts, thorough nail trims, and clean coats that smell great. Owners of doodles, schnauzers, and long-haired breeds report that styling matches their preferences. Pets come away clean, neatly trimmed, and refreshed after each visit."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
